# v2.0.36. THE POLYHEDRON IS THE WRONG SIZE FOR THE ION IN IT.
#
# bond_size_z is this site's mean bond length minus Gagne's mean for the same
# element, valence and coordination, in units of Gagne's OWN sd for that
# configuration. Scaled by the observed spread rather than by a percentage,
# because the spread runs from 1.2% of the bond for Sn(IV)O6 to 7.3% for
# Mn(III)O6 - a ninefold range, over which one fractional margin cannot serve.
