# FITTED ON SOMETHING THAT IS NOT THE INDEX. A contracted polyhedron is
# over-bonded by construction, so fitting on gii would be fitting on
# arithmetic. The fit is on the rate at which an entry disagrees with every
# OTHER published determination of the same compound in the corpus, which uses
# neither bond valence nor Gagne. Over 1161 sites with at least three peers:
#
#     |z| bin      0-0.5  0.5-1  1-1.5  1.5-2  2-2.5  3-4   4+
#     outside all    13%    15%    16%    26%    52%  54%  47%
#
