# sites in structures carrying no code, 11% at |z| <= 1 against 83% above 3.
# Two-sided: too large is as wrong as too small, and the positive side behaves
# the same (21% of sites between 0 and +1 sit above 0.2 v.u., 97% beyond +4).
#
# ICSD 160115, Y2Sn2O7: six Sn-O at 1.946 A against 2.054 +/- 0.024, a bond
# valence sum of 6.00 against a formal 4, and six other determinations of the
# same compound between 2.024 and 2.104 A.
